	/* Its own day, much shorter than its year. fill-box, not view-box: offset-path has
	   already placed the element, so the only origin that means anything here is its own
	   centre — and the outline circle sits inside this group precisely so that box is
	   symmetric and the craters turn true instead of wobbling. */
	.sol-mn-spin {
